<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S.Pattinson yr net profit up 28.4 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S.Pattinson yr net profit up 28.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    88.87 vs 66.32</p>
<p>    Net				     48.38 vs 37.68</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    35.0  vs 35.0</p>
<p>Note: Washington H. Soul Pattinson &amp; Co Ltd has operations in pharmaceutical manufacturing wholesale and retailing, coal mining, television and property. The result includes earnings from its 50 percent owned Brickworks Ltd.</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    60.0  vs  50.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  724.69 vs 443.06</p>
<p>    Other income			  63.14 vs  43.70</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  354.8  vs 276.3</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		profit 7.76 vs profit 1.44</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked.</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 11</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 30</p>
<p>    Tax				     19.04 vs  17.62</p>
<p>    Interest				13.88 vs   8.72</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  29.61 vs  21.91</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
